+9. Clean up all **implementer subagent** worktrees, then delete each merged ticket branch **from the integration worktree**, so `-d` checks it against the integration branch rather than `main`: `git -C <integration worktree> branch -d <integration-branch>--t<T>`. Never `-D`.
